    "property_name": "4 bed terraced house for sale",
    "description": "Ivy Gate are delighted to offer to the market this immaculately presented and deceptively spacious (2000+ sq. Ft) three story family home located within prestigious Worcester Park 'Hamptons' development. Built in 2011, Westmount Close formed part of the last phase of the build by St James developments. Set within 30 acres of landscaped grounds, the area provides a modern and secure lifestyle and a fantastic community feel, with the added benefits and unlimited use of a gymnasium, tennis courts, children's play area, a communal hall that can be reserved for parties and the Mayflower Park which includes a grass amphitheatre for performances and an area of five wetlands as a nature reserve. Worcester Park offers a wide range of shops, bars and restaurants including; Waitrose, Sainsburys, Boots, Nandoâs, Pizza Express and the big brand coffee houses, as well as its own Mainline Train Station providing easy access to central London. A number of useful bus services running through Worcester Park, allowing easy access to Sutton, Cheam, New Malden and Kingston, as well as numerous well regarded local schools. Internal accommodation comprises; a spacious entrance hallway leading to a beautiful rear aspect open plan kitchen with integrated appliances and dining/family room giving direct access and views over the rear garden with its patio area, the ideal environment for entertaining, and further lawned area. On the ground floor there is also a storage room/home office/occasional bedroom (5) which has been created by utilising some of the space from the original garage. In addition there is a cloakroom/W.C and internal access to the remainder of the garage space. To the first floor there is a large reception room to the front complete with balcony overlooking the communal gardens and development water feature, whilst to the rear of the house is the primary bedroom complete with walk-in dressing and wardrobe area and en-suite bathroom complete with separate shower and bath / W.C. Situated on the top floor are 3 further bedrooms, the largest of which benefits from a further en-suite shower room / W.C. A main family bathroom/W.C is also situated on this level along with access to the unusually large loft space. Externally the property benefits from a private rear garden complete with home office / summer house, whilst to the front off street parking. For the commuter, the A3 is a mere 5 minute drive away providing direct links to central London and Worcester Park station is a 12 minute walk away and offers a convenient route to Waterloo in only 25 minutes. There is the added bonus of having the M25 just a 20 min drive away, which opens the door to travel throughout the UK. EPC Rating:",
