    "description": "Well proportioned three bedroom terraced family home (1,069 Sq.Ft) with private garden and no onward chain, superbly situated close to Wimbledon Chase and Raynes Park stations. The property offers bright and spacious accommodation with enormous potential for further extension and upgrade as desired (STPP). Flowing extended living space to the ground floor, including a double length reception room and extended full width kitchen/diner to the rear, creates the ideal layout for a modern lifestyle, with plenty of space for a growing family. Further features include upstairs bathroom and ground floor WC, quality floor coverings, inbuilt storage, gas central heating and double glazing. Accommodation comprises a generous entrance hall with stairs rising to the first floor and access to guest WC, leading into the double length reception room with ample space for relaxing and entertaining and double doors through to the kitchen/diner. The kitchen/diner, with doors onto the garden and part pitched glazed roof, comprises a modern range of matching wall and base units with work surfaces incorporating inset sink unit, gas hob and further space for appliances. To the first floor, there are three well sized bedrooms, plus a family bathroom with white suite. The property is very conveniently located within easy access of Wimbledon Chase and Raynes Park stations, as well as regular bus routes, all providing excellent fast and frequent connections into Central London and to the surrounding area. The centre of Wimbledon is also within a short distance providing further rail links as well as underground services. The A3 is close-by for good vehicular access and the area is well served by a variety of shops and amenities, as well as lovely open spaces and excellent schools. Wimbledon Village, with its boutique cafes and restaurants, and Wimbledon Common are also within easy reach. Viewings are highly recommended. Property Ref; DA0587 * Please note that some of the images have been digitally staged to show the potential of the property. All actual photos are also included for full disclosure.",
