    "property_name": "4 bed detached house for sale",
    "description": "Set in a peaceful location and enjoying a wide frontage, is this attractive immaculately maintained and beautifully presented, modern detached house. The accommodation is arranged over two floors and is well balanced and generously proportioned, making it equally suitable for those looking to downsize as it is or for a growing family. Upstairs, the principal bedroom is positioned to the rear of the house and enjoys far reaching views. It also benefits from an en-suite shower room. There are two further double bedrooms, a good sized single bedroom, and a family bathroom completing the first floor. On the ground floor, the layout flows comfortably. The kitchen leads into a private dining room, which opens into a spacious family and entertaining room. A full width conservatory sits to the rear, providing a lovely place to relax and enjoy views over the garden throughout the year. A guest WC and an integral garage complete the ground floor. The property also offers excellent potential to reconfigure and/or extend, including the possibility of converting the integral garage into additional living space, creating a double fronted home, subject to the usual consents. To the rear, the very private and exceptionally well-maintained garden measures approximately 112ft in length and enjoys open views providing a rare and peaceful outlook. Set in a quiet residential road in the heart of West Molesey, the property is well placed for transport links with both Hersham and Hampton Court stations are both within easy reach, with regular services to London Waterloo. There are also regular bus routes links to Kingston, Walton and Esher. The excellent Hurst Park Primary (0.4 mile) and the new Heathside Secondary school (1.5 miles) are both nearby, providing first-class education on the doorstep. Property Reference DA058",
