    "description": "A deceptively spacious four bedroom detached house, tucked away in a quiet Ewell Village cul-de-sac. Extended &amp; remodelled in 2024 to now create a substantial family home, providing three double bedrooms upstairs and a further fourth double bedroom on the ground floor, ideal for visiting guests, teenagers or relatives. The main first floor bedroom features a Jack and Jill ensuite/family bathroom, built in double wardrobe and media space, and a wired Daikin air-conditioning/heater unit. Substantial eves storage runs along each side of the second floor with access doors in all 3 bedrooms and to the rear of the airing cupboard on the landing. The bedroom on the ground floor also benefits from an air conditioning/heater unit and access to its own bathroom. There is a further ground floor cloakroom, separate utility and open plan fitted kitchen that flows in to a family dining area. A large bright separate living room has flexibility to incorporate a play area or office space and is complemented by a third air conditioning unit. Off-road parking on the driveway provides space for at least 3 vehicles. The location is fantastic, being a short walk from the village with its shops, cafes, library and parks, and Ewell West (Waterloo) and Ewell East (Victoria/London Bridge) stations. The large Sainsburyâs superstore at Kiln Lane is also just close by. A perfect spot for families seeking good local schools such as Wallace Fields, Ewell Grove, Glyn, Blenheim and Rosebery. With its flexible layout and prime village location, this property is ready to welcome a new family to enjoy all it has to offer. EPC Rating: C Parking - Off Street Disclaimer Every care has been taken in the preparation of property particulars, but we do not guarantee the accuracy of the information provided. The details are intended as a general guide and do not constitute, nor form part of, an offer or contract. All measurements, floor areas, distances, and descriptions are approximate and should not be relied upon as statements of fact. Prospective purchasers/tenants must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each statement contained in these particulars. Fixtures, fittings and appliances referred to have not been tested and no guarantee can be given that they are in working order. Greenfield Estate Agents (Ewell) Limited, its employees or representatives have no authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatsoever in relation to a property",
