    "property_name": "5 bed semi-detached house for sale",
    "description": "-Full Description- This outstanding property is arranged over three floors and has been finished to an exceptional standard, offering a stylish and highly functional layout suited to modern living. The ground floor is centred around a superb open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area, creating a bright and sociable heart of the home. The contemporary kitchen is complemented by sleek finishes and ample storage. Additional ground floor spaces include two office/reception rooms, a utility room, a cloakroom, and a W.C., providing excellent flexibility for home working or family needs. The first floor offers three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with an en-suite, along with a modern family bathroom and landing area. On the second floor, an additional large bedroom suite benefits from its own shower room and adjoining dressing/storage space, creating a private retreat ideal for guests or older children. Further enhancing the property is a self-contained annex, featuring a bedroom, kitchen/living area, and bathroom. This versatile space is perfect for extended family, visitors, independent living, or potential rental income. Throughout the home, the exceptional quality of finish is immediately apparent, with careful attention to detail, contemporary fittings, and a cohesive, high-spec aesthetic. -Location &amp; Lifestyle- Situated in a popular residential area of Whitton, this exceptional home enjoys a convenient and family-friendly setting within easy reach of excellent schools, transport connections, and local amenities. -Schools- The property is ideally positioned for a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, making it an excellent choice for families. Well-rated options nearby include Chase Bridge Primary School, Nelson Primary School, and Waldegrave School, with additional reputable secondary and sixth-form options within the wider Twickenham and Richmond borough. 5min walking distance from Kneller Hall School, an upcoming independent secondary school in Twickenham, part of the Dukes Education group, set to open in September 2027 -Transport Links- Whitton and Twickenham railway stations are both easily accessible, providing direct services into London Waterloo, making this an ideal location for commuters. The area is also well served by local bus routes and offers convenient road access to the A316, M3, and wider motorway network, connecting to Central London, Heathrow Airport, Richmond, and Kingston. The location offers excellent connectivity into Central London and surrounding areas. -Local Amenities &amp; Recreation- The property is within easy reach of Whitton High Street, offering a variety of supermarkets, independent shops, cafÃ©s, and everyday conveniences. Nearby Twickenham town centre provides a wider selection of restaurants, boutiques, and leisure facilities. For outdoor recreation, residents can enjoy nearby parks and green spaces, including Murray Park, just 2min waking distance, Crane Park and Kneller Gardens, as well as riverside walks along the Thames in nearby Richmond and Twickenham. The area also offers excellent sports and leisure facilities, including gyms, rugby clubs, and golf courses. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious, beautifully finished home offering versatility, comfort, and modern style in equal measure. Disclaimer Whilst we make enquiries with the Seller to ensure the information provided is accurate, Yopa makes no representations or warranties of any kind with respect to the statements contained in the particulars which should not be relied upon as representations of fact. All representations contained in the particulars are based on details supplied by the Seller. Your Conveyancer is legally responsible for ensuring any purchase agreement fully protects your position. Please inform us if you become aware of any information being inaccurate. Money Laundering Regulations Should a purchaser(s) have an offer accepted on a property marketed by Yopa, they will need to undertake an identification check and asked to provide information on the source and proof of funds. This is done to meet our obligation under Anti Money Laundering Regulations (aml) and is a legal requirement. We use a specialist third party service together with an in-house compliance team to verify your information. The cost of these checks is Â£82.50 +VAT per purchase, which is paid in advance, when an offer is agreed and prior to a sales memorandum being issued. This charge is non-refundable under any circumstances",
