    "description": "An attractive three bedroom family house in a popular Wimbledon location. Description This charming three bedroom house has been refurbished by the current owners and offers well balanced living and entertaining space across three floors. The property is set back from the road behind a pretty walled front garden and is approached via a tiled pathway. The house opens to a deep hallway with attractive wood panelling. To the front is a bay fronted reception room with an attractive period fireplace and bespoke display shelving. To the rear is a superb open plan kitchen/dining/reception room creating a wonderful multi purpose living space. The contemporary kitchen offers a wide range of units and cupboards, with integrated appliances and a central island. Bi folding doors open to a paved terrace overlooking a private, rear garden. A utility room/guest cloakroom is located off the hallway by the kitchen. Upstairs, on the first floor to the front is a large double bedroom with an attractive fireplace, good natural light and generous fitted wardrobes. To the rear is an additional bedroom, and a contemporary family bathroom. On the second floor, is a generous principal bedroom suite with wonderful views of the garden. There is a stylish en suite shower room, built in wardrobes and accessible eaves storage. Location Victory Road is a popular tree lined residential street in the desirable \"Battles Area\" of Wimbledon. Good transport links can be found at Wimbledon rail station about a mile away (approx.17 minutes to London Waterloo) and South Wimbledon Northern line underground approx. 0.3 miles away. The shops, cinemas, gyms, supermarkets and restaurants of Wimbledon Town are approx. A mile away. There are a good selection of popular schools nearby. Wimbledon Village with its cafes, restaurants and pretty boutiques is 1.5 miles approx. Away along with Wimbledon Common with 1200 acres of open space to golf, horse ride, cycle and walk. Travel times provided by Distances provided by Google Pedometer All measurements are approximate. Square Footage: 1,528 sq ft Additional Info On street parking Resident's parking permit Electric charging point at the end of the road Gas central heating Broadban",
